                <pb facs="0714" n="634" xml:id="pg634"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 9.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Livingston to Mr.
                            Powell.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Consulate of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Cape Haitien</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-08-12"><hi rendition="#italic">August 12,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>McCrea holds blockade ineffective. Will protect American, Cuban, and innocenl
                    neutral commerce.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Livingston.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
